  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening resilience, quality and equity of education systems in West Africa</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO will support the Member States in West Africa to strengthen the resilience and effectiveness of their education systems to respond effectively to the significant challenges of achieving SDG4. Today&apos;s development challenges in the countries covered by the Dakar Office are dynamic with multidimensional risks that require integrated solutions. To do so, we will prioritize where country demands are greatest providing technical assistance and capacity development in key areas, in line with national education sector plans, Transforming Education Summit (TES) national commitments and the themes of the AU Year of Education 2024.</narrative>
  </description>
